      "content": "### Day-2\n\nfor today it was quite good really loved the game and how it teach the interaction in it was very interesting. \nand the coding part was nostalgic hit also the first activity was interesting  because when I was doing my b.tech I had a hard time figuring out what is div but today by physically doing the thing on paper it cleared up.\n\n\n<img width=\"1847\" height=\"985\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1898b6e0-5b10-4ffa-b5bf-96cb2f5e0fe3\" />\n\n ",
